## 2. 🦠 Virus Target yang Relevan

Untuk "Acute Respiratory Viral Infections", kemungkinan besar virus yang akan dicover:

### Tier 1 (Pasti)
| Virus | Alasan | Database Utama |
|-------|--------|---------------|
| **SARS-CoV-2** | Masih relevan, banyak varian/clade | GISAID, GenBank |
| **Influenza A (H1N1, H3N2)** | Musiman, pandemi historis | GISAID, FluDB |
| **Influenza B** | Musiman | GISAID, FluDB |

### Tier 2 (Sangat Mungkin)
| Virus | Alasan | Database Utama |
|-------|--------|---------------|
| **RSV (Respiratory Syncytial Virus)** | Penyebab utama pneumonia anak | GenBank, BV-BRC |
| **Human Metapneumovirus (hMPV)** | Emerging, WHO surveillance | GenBank |
| **Adenovirus** | Respiratory types (3, 7, 14, 21) | GenBank |

### Tier 3 (Mungkin)
| Virus | Alasan | Database Utama |
|-------|--------|---------------|
| **Rhinovirus** | Penyebab common cold terbanyak | GenBank |
| **Parainfluenza** | Croup, bronchiolitis | GenBank |
| **Human Coronavirus (229E, OC43, NL63, HKU1)** | Seasonal coronavirus | GenBank |
| **Bocavirus** | Emerging respiratory pathogen | GenBank |

> [!NOTE]
> **Tanyakan ke supervisor**: Virus mana saja yang masuk dalam scope? Ini sangat menentukan pipeline design karena tiap virus punya karakteristik genomik berbeda (segmented vs non-segmented, RNA vs DNA, ukuran genome, dll).

