## 5. 🛠️ Tech Stack Rekomendasi

### Pipeline Orchestration
| Tool | Deskripsi | Rekomendasi |
|------|-----------|-------------|
| **Snakemake** | Python-based workflow manager | ⭐⭐⭐ Paling populer di bioinformatics |
| **Nextflow** | Groovy-based, container-native | ⭐⭐⭐ Bagus untuk HPC/cloud |
| **Python scripts** | Direct scripting | ⭐⭐ Simpel tapi kurang reproducible |

> [!TIP]
> **Rekomendasi**: Gunakan **Snakemake** karena Python-native (lebih mudah buat kamu), well-documented, dan sudah standard di bioinformatics. Plus bisa easily scale ke HPC jika nanti butuh.

### Core Bioinformatics Tools
| Step | Tool | Bahasa |
|------|------|--------|
| Sequence handling | BioPython, SeqKit | Python, Go |
| MSA | MAFFT, MUSCLE5 | C/C++ |
| Phylogenetics | IQ-TREE2, FastTree | C/C++ |
| Tree visualization | ETE3, ggtree, iTOL | Python, R, Web |
| Primer design | Primer3, PrimerBLAST | C, Web |
| Stats & visualization | pandas, plotly, seaborn | Python |
| Report generation | Quarto, Jinja2 | Multi |

### Environment & Reproducibility
| Tool | Deskripsi |
|------|-----------|
| **Conda/Mamba** | Package management |
| **Docker/Singularity** | Containerization |
| **Git** | Version control |
| **environment.yml** | Reproducible environments |

