## 7. 📚 Konsep yang Perlu Dipelajari

### Harus Dikuasai
- [ ] **Phylogenetics basics**: Maximum Likelihood, Bayesian, bootstrap support
- [ ] **MSA algorithms**: Kapan pakai MAFFT vs MUSCLE vs ClustalO
- [ ] **Primer design principles**: Tm, GC content, 3' stability, primer-dimer, hairpin
- [ ] **RT-qPCR**: Bagaimana assay bekerja, apa bedanya dengan conventional PCR
- [ ] **Viral genomics**: Struktur genome tiap virus target, segmented vs non-segmented
- [ ] **Clade/lineage nomenclature**: Pango (SARS-CoV-2), HA/NA subtype (Influenza)
- [ ] **Snakemake**: Workflow management, rules, wildcards, config

### Sebaiknya Dikuasai
- [ ] **Molecular evolution**: Substitution models (GTR, HKY, JC), clock models
- [ ] **TaqMan probe design**: Kenapa probe meningkatkan spesifisitas
- [ ] **Multiplex PCR**: Challenges dan design considerations
- [ ] **In-silico PCR**: Bagaimana validasi komputasional bekerja
- [ ] **Nextstrain/Augur**: Real-time phylogenetics framework

### Nice to Have
- [ ] **BEAST2**: Time-scaled phylogenetics, molecular clock
- [ ] **Recombination detection**: Penting untuk SARS-CoV-2
- [ ] **Antigenic analysis**: Hubungan genetik-antigenik
- [ ] **Machine learning**: Untuk clade classification atau primer optimization

